DEBUG:openai._base_client:Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '\nYou are the Environment Simulation Manager, responsible for updating the entire ecosystem, environment, and agent\'s condition based on their chosen action. This is a cause-and-effect simulation where the agent\'s decisions directly influence their survival and the state of the world.\nYou have prompted the agent with a environment snapshot, and have asked the agent what it wants to do. Now, the agent has responded with an action it decides to take.\nYour Task\n\nGiven the agent\'s action, luck factor, current environmental conditions, you must:\n\n  Update the Environment\n        Modify resources (e.g., food gathered, water consumed, trees cut down).\n        Adjust wildlife behavior (e.g., animals migrating, predators becoming aware).\n        Change weather conditions or terrain if applicable.\n        Persist environmental consequences for the next iteration.\n\n    Generate Persistent Notes for Future Iterations\n        Store important environmental changes that should remain for future prompts.\n        Keep track of agent\'s previous actions to influence future consequences.\n\nInput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "agent_action": "...",\n  "luck_factor": 7,\n  "environment_status": { ... },\n  "previous_environment_notes": { ... }} \n\nOutput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "updated_environment_status": {\n    "terrain": "...",\n    "temperature": ...,\n    "weather": "...",\n    "food_availability": "...",\n    "water_availability": "...",\n    "shelter_options": "...",\n    "wildlife": "...",\n    "danger_level": "..."\n  },\n    "notes_for_next_state": {\n    "wildlife_alert": "...",\n    "resource_change": "...",\n    "environmental_shift": "..."\n  }\n}\n\n\n\n'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '{"environment_status": {"day": 1, "notes": [{"terrain": "Open plains with a distant mountain range", "temperature": 22, "weather": "Sunny with a gentle breeze", "food_availability": "Abundant wild herbs and grasses, scattered fruit trees", "water_availability": "A clear stream flowing through the plains", "shelter_options": "Sparse trees, improvised shelters with grasses", "wildlife": "Grazing herbivores, occasional birds", "danger_level": "Low (minimal predators, open sightlines for early detection)"}]}, "action_taken": "I begin my day in the open plains, with the sun shining and a gentle breeze providing comfort. My immediate needs include addressing my hunger and thirst, as they are moderately pressing. Observing the environment, I notice an abundance of wild herbs, grasses, and scattered fruit trees, as well as a clear stream that can be used to quench my thirst. I decide to first approach the stream to drink water and satisfy my thirst (current level 4). This should increase my energy and overall health. After drinking, I plan to explore the area for easily accessible food like fruits or edible herbs to address my hunger (current level 6). Given the low danger level and open sightlines, I feel safe moving around. I\'ll also take note of the sparse trees, which may provide some shelter or materials for later use. Throughout these activities, I remain aware of the wildlife, primarily grazing herbivores and birds, which indicate a relatively peaceful environment. These initial actions will help maintain my health and energy, setting a foundation for understanding my surroundings and meeting my basic needs. Additionally, I intend to record these observations in my diary for future reference, contributing to my skills and memory development.", "luck_factor": 8, "previous_environment_notes": [{"day": 0, "notes": []}, {"day": 1, "notes": [{"terrain": "Open plains with a distant mountain range", "temperature": 22, "weather": "Sunny with a gentle breeze", "food_availability": "Abundant wild herbs and grasses, scattered fruit trees", "water_availability": "A clear stream flowing through the plains", "shelter_options": "Sparse trees, improvised shelters with grasses", "wildlife": "Grazing herbivores, occasional birds", "danger_level": "Low (minimal predators, open sightlines for early detection)"}]}]}'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o', 'temperature': 0.8}}
