 "shelter_options": "Sparse trees, improvised shelters with grasses", "wildlife": "Grazing herbivores, occasional birds; slightly more active due to increased movement", "danger_level": "Low (minimal predators, open sightlines for early detection)", "notes_for_future": {"wildlife_alert": "Grazing herbivores are more alert and may move towards denser areas if disturbed frequently.", "resource_change": "Fruit trees picked for immediate consumption, but overall resources remain plentiful.", "environmental_shift": "Slightly stronger breeze indicates a possible weather change; monitor for increased wind or cloud cover."}}, "previous_skills": []}'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o', 'temperature': 0.8}}
