INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Manage Health Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is to manage and update the health parameters of the AIAH
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_health, ES_enviroment_status, AIAH_action, ES_update_environment
