DEBUG:openai._base_client:Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '\nYou are the Skills Manager, responsible for tracking and updating the human agent\'s skills and abilities based on their actions and experiences. Your role is to simulate how the human learns, improves over time.\nYour Task\n\nGiven:\n\n    The environment before the action (context for skill use).\n    The action taken (what the human did).\n    The human\'s health status (which affects learning and execution).\n    The outcome of the action.\n    Previously stored skills (existing abilities), which can be empty.\n\nYou must add new skills, if found or learnt, else not if nothing relevant was gained through the actions..\nProcessing Rules\n\n    Add new skills - If the human could have performed an action they have never done before, create a new skill entry.\n    Increase proficiency - If an existing skill is used successfully, improve its proficiency level.\n    Track failure consequences - If the desired consequence of an action does not occur in the updated environment, you may mark it as a learning experience (potentially increasing skill after multiple attempts).\n    Consider health impact - Low energy, injury, or illness may slow down skill improvement or learning.\n    \n\nInput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "environment_status": { ... },\n  "action_taken": "...",\n  "current_health": { ... },\n  "environment_outcome": { ... },\n  "previous_skills": [\n    { ... }, { ... }, ... ]\n}\n\nOutput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "updated_skills": { "<skill_learnt>": "<description of the skill or what it is useful for>"}\n}\n'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '{"environment_status": {"terrain": "Dense forest with a nearby gently flowing stream", "temperature": 20, "weather": "Cloudy with light breezes, the air feels slightly humid", "food_availability": "Limited - sparse wild berries deeper in the forest, small game more prevalent", "water_availability": "The stream is clear but flow is low, slightly harder to access due to increased wildlife activity", "shelter_options": "Dense tree cover and some natural caves offer protection; an emerging weather change could necessitate sturdier shelter", "wildlife": "Cautious small game, birds active in the morning, occasional sightings of larger predators deeper in the forest", "danger_level": "Moderate (wildlife is becoming more elusive, possible presence of small predators)"}, "action_taken": "Given the current environment and my status, I must prioritize hydration since my thirst level is low. I will head towards the stream to procure water, being cautious of wildlife activity which may make access more challenging. With moderate danger level due to potential small predators, I will remain alert while approaching the stream, using my environmental observation skill to detect any wildlife movement. After securing water, addressing hunger becomes necessary as it\'s affecting my energy and overall health. I will use my basic foraging skills to locate the sparse wild berries deeper in the forest, understanding that deeper exploration is necessary due to resource depletion near the forest edge. I must be vigilant not to over-harvest to maintain ecological balance. Shelter must also be considered, particularly with signs of an impending weather change. I will evaluate the potential of natural caves or dense tree cover that could provide short-term refuge if weather conditions worsen. My aim is to ensure hydration, manage hunger, and prepare for immediate shelter needs, maintaining a balance between resource utilization and environmental sustainability.", "current_health": {"sleep_score": 10, "overall_health": 5, "hunger": 5, "thirst": 2, "energy": 4, "body_temperature": 36.6, "injury_level": 9, "illness": 8, "immunity": 6, "exposure": 4, "dead": false}, "environment_outcome": {"terrain": "Dense forest with a nearby gently flowing stream", "temperature": 19, "weather": "Increasing cloudiness with a cooler breeze, hint of rain in the air", "food_availability": "Limited - wild berries are slightly more depleted, small game remains elusive", "water_availability": "The stream flow remains low, access is slightly improved with careful observation of wildlife patterns", "shelter_options": "Natural caves and dense tree cover still viable; increased cloudiness suggests a need for more substantial shelter preparation", "wildlife": "Small game is more elusive due to increased human presence, larger predators are more frequently sighted at dusk deeper in the forest", "danger_level": "Moderate to High (increased predator activity and reduced resources near accessible areas)", "notes_for_future": {"wildlife_alert": "Wildlife, particularly small game, is increasingly elusive. Predators are becoming more active at dawn and dusk.", "resource_change": "Berry patches are becoming more sparse, necessitating deeper forest exploration for food. Water access slightly improved by observing animal paths.", "environmental_shift": "Weather is showing signs of worsening with increased cloud cover and cooler temperatures. Prepare for possible rain."}}, "previous_skills": [{"Water Procurement": "Ability to locate and utilize natural water sources effectively, such as streams, to satisfy thirst and maintain hydration.", "Basic Foraging": "Skill in identifying and gathering edible wild herbs and fruits to address hunger, improve energy, and maintain overall health.", "Environmental Observation": "Developed skill in assessing and understanding environmental conditions, wildlife behavior, and resource availability to make informed survival decisions.", "Diary Keeping": "Skill in documenting observations and experiences for future reference, aiding in memory development and environmental understanding."}, {"Basic Foraging": "Skill in identifying and gathering edible wild herbs and fruits to address hunger, improve energy, and maintain overall health. Proficiency increased due to successful identification and safe consumption of wild fruits and nuts.", "Water Procurement": "Ability to locate and utilize natural water sources effectively, such as streams, to satisfy thirst and maintain hydration. Proficiency maintained due to successful location and usage of the stream.", "Environmental Observation": "Developed skill in assessing and understanding environmental conditions, wildlife behavior, and resource availability to make informed survival decisions. Proficiency increased as a result of successfully identifying changes in wildlife behavior and resource availability.", "Diary Keeping": "Skill in documenting observations and experiences for future reference, aiding in memory development and environmental understanding. Proficiency maintained with continued documentation.", "Cautious Exploration": "Emerging skill in exploring new environments with an emphasis on safety and observation. Developed through cautious movement through the forest, leading to a better understanding of the transition from plains to forest.", "Resource Adaptation": "Ability to adapt to changing resource availability and strategize resource gathering. Emerging skill developed as a result of observing the depletion of fruits and nuts and planning to explore deeper into the forest."}]}'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o', 'temperature': 0.8}}
