kill in monitoring wildlife behavior, particularly predator activity, to ensure safety during resource gathering. Developed through sustained vigilance and adaptation to changes in predator activity post-rain.'}}, 'simulation_day_count': 7, 'day_luck_factor': 8, 'simulation_total_days': 10, 'llm_model': 'gpt', 'verbose': True}
