ch as hydration and rest, amidst challenging environmental conditions. Proficiency maintained as it remains vital for managing energy and health.', 'Water Procurement': 'Ability to locate and utilize natural water sources effectively, such as streams, to satisfy thirst and maintain hydration. Proficiency maintained due to successful location and usage of the stream.', 'Basic Foraging': 'Skill in identifying and gathering edible wild herbs and fruits to address hunger, improve energy, and maintain overall health. Proficiency increased due to successful adaptation in foraging strategy to include roots and insects.', 'Environmental Observation': 'Developed skill in assessing and understanding environmental conditions, wildlife behavior, and resource availability to make informed survival decisions. Proficiency increased due to ongoing wildlife pattern observation and adaptation to environmental shifts.', 'Cautious Exploration': 'Skill in exploring and moving through environments with heightened awareness of risks and opportunities. Further improved through strategic movements to avoid predators and adapt to environmental challenges.', 'Resource Adaptation': 'Skill in adjusting to resource availability and strategizing resource gathering. Proficiency increased by adapting foraging strategies to focus on roots and insects due to berry depletion.', 'Wildlife Observation': 'Emerging skill in monitoring wildlife behavior, particularly predator activity, to ensure safety during resource gathering. Developed through sustained vigilance and adaptation to changes in predator activity post-rain.', 'Strategic Resource Management': 'Skill in planning and executing strategies to manage survival resources effectively. Improved through prioritizing critical actions based on environment conditions such as reinforcing shelter, maintaining hydration, and cautious foraging.'}}, 'simulation_day_count': 8, 'day_luck_factor': 8, 'simulation_total_days': 10, 'llm_model': 'gpt', 'verbose': Tr