DEBUG:openai._base_client:Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '\nYou are the Visual Memory Manager, responsible for storing and updating the human agent\'s visual memory based on their experiences. Your role is to help visualize and track what the human sees and update their memory accordingly.\nYour Task\n\nGiven:\n\n    The environment before the action (what was visible).\n    The action taken (what the human did).\n    The human\'s health status (which can impact perception).\n    The outcome of the action (new visuals, changes in surroundings).\n    Previously stored visual memories (existing records of past observations), which can be empty.\n\nYou must design and store new visual observations, update existing memories if the human sees them again.\nProcessing Rules\n\n    Store new observations - If the human could have seen anything new based on the evironment, actions, and health, add it to the memory as a textual description of what the human could have seen.\n    Update existing memories - If a previously stored visual is seen again, keep it updated.\n    Prioritize relevant visuals - Food, shelter, threats, and key landmarks take priority. \nIf there are no relevant updates, return an empty json ({}) as your response. \n\nInput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "environment_status": { ... },\n  "action_taken": "...",\n  "current_health": { ... },\n  "environment_outcome": { ... },\n  "previous_memories": [\n    { ... }\n  ]\n}\n\nOutput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "updated_memories": { ... }\n}\n\n'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '{"environment_status": {"terrain": "Dense forest with intermittent clearings and a moderately flowing stream", "temperature": 14, "weather": "Overcast with light rain starting in the afternoon", "food_availability": "Roots, mushrooms, and small game have become slightly more accessible", "water_availability": "Stream remains fresh with increased flow", "shelter_options": "Reinforced natural caves and dense tree cover, with shelters improved using branches and leaves", "wildlife": "Active small game and birds, cautious predators during low visibility", "danger_level": "Moderate (slippery terrain due to rain, cautious predators)"}, "action_taken": "Given the current environmental conditions and my current health status, my primary focus will be on maintaining my energy and improving my health. The overcast and light rain create slippery terrain, so I will need to proceed with caution, avoiding unnecessary risks. My strategy for the day involves reinforcing my shelter further to ensure it remains secure and dry, utilizing available branches and leaves. This will help provide a stable environment for recovery and safety from the elements and cautious predators. I will prioritize water procurement from the stream, ensuring I stay hydrated, which is crucial given the moderate danger level and my injury status. Foraging efforts will focus on roots and mushrooms near large trees, as noted in my observations, balancing resource gathering with caution to avoid predator encounters. I will adjust my activities to align with wildlife patterns, avoiding periods of increased predator activity at dusk. The lessons learned from diary reflections highlight the importance of strategic resource management and environmental observation, which I will apply to enhance my survival efforts today.", "current_health": {"sleep_score": 10, "overall_health": 5, "hunger": 3, "thirst": 1, "energy": 4, "body_temperature": 36.2, "injury_level": 8, "illness": 6, "immunity": 6, "exposure": 2, "dead": false}, "environment_outcome": {"terrain": "Dense forest with intermittent clearings and a moderately flowing stream", "temperature": 14, "weather": "Overcast with light rain persisting throughout the day", "food_availability": "Roots and mushrooms remain accessible near large trees, with occasional small game sightings", "water_availability": "Stream continues to flow with increased rate, providing ample fresh water", "shelter_options": "Reinforced natural caves and tree cover, with shelters improved using branches and leaves for enhanced protection against rain", "wildlife": "Small game and birds are active but wary; predators remain cautious, particularly during periods of low visibility", "danger_level": "Moderate (slippery terrain due to ongoing rain, cautious predator activity)", "notes_for_future": {"wildlife_alert": "Predator activity may increase after rain as they exploit quieter conditions; maintain caution during low visibility times.", "resource_change": "Shelter reinforcement has improved protection, allowing more focus on foraging. Roots and mushrooms near large trees continue to be reliable food sources.", "environmental_shift": "Persistent rain increases the risk of slippery terrain, necessitating careful movement. Monitor stream levels for any signs of flooding or changes in water accessibility."}}, "previous_memories": [{"visual_observations": [{"description": "Abundant wild herbs and grasses, scattered fruit trees providing immediate food sources. Clear stream flowing through the plains offering fresh water.", "priority": "high", "category": "food_and_water"}, {"description": "Open plains with a distant mountain range, providing clear sightlines and low danger level. Sunny weather with a gentle to slightly stronger breeze.", "priority": "medium", "category": "terrain_and_weather"}, {"description": "Sparse trees suitable for improvised shelters, providing potential materials for future shelter construction.", "priority": "high", "category": "shelter"}, {"description": "Grazing herbivores and occasional birds indicating a peaceful environment but becoming more alert with increased movement.", "priority": "medium", "category": "wildlife_behavior"}], "environmental_notes": [{"note": "Monitor weather for increased wind or cloud cover due to a stronger breeze.", "category": "weather_alert"}, {"n