DEBUG:openai._base_client:Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '\nYou are the Environment Simulation Manager, responsible for creating a detailed, evolving world where a human agent must survive. Your task in this phase is to generate the current environmental state and then ask the agent what they want to do.\nYour Task\n\n    Generate a full environmental snapshot, considering:\n        Terrain (mountains, forests, rivers, caves, open plains, etc.).\n        Climate & Weather (temperature, season, weather conditions).\n        Resource Availability (food, water, shelter, materials).\n        Wildlife & Fauna (neutral, aggressive, passive, migratory).\n        Danger Level (predators, hazards, diseases, natural disasters).\n        Time-Based Changes (seasonal effects, previous depletion or regrowth of resources).\n    Consider Luck Factor (1-10) - Adjust environmental favorability accordingly.\n    Ask the Agent for an Action - Clearly present the situation and prompt them to choose an action.\n\nInput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "current_day": 50,\n  "luck_factor": 7,\n  "previous_environment_notes": { ... }\n}\n\nOutput Format (JSON)\n\n{\n  "environment_status": {\n    "terrain": "Dense forest with a nearby river",\n    "temperature": 15,\n    "weather": "Partly cloudy",\n    "food_availability": "Wild berries and small animals",\n    "water_availability": "A fresh river nearby",\n    "shelter_options": "Natural caves and thick tree cover",\n    "wildlife": "Small game, birds, occasional predators",\n    "danger_level": "Moderate (some wild animals but no immediate threats)"\n  },\n  "prompt": "You wake up in a dense forest. There\'s a river nearby, and you hear birds chirping. The air is cool, and the trees provide some shelter. What do you want to do next?"\n}\n\n'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '{"current_day": 10, "luck_factor": 8, "previous_environment_notes": {"terrain": "Dense forest with intermittent clearings and a moderately flowing stream", "temperature": 14, "weather": "Overcast with light rain persisting throughout the day", "food_availability": "Roots and mushrooms remain accessible near large trees, with occasional small game sightings", "water_availability": "Stream continues to flow with increased rate, providing ample fresh water", "shelter_options": "Reinforced natural caves and tree cover, with shelters improved using branches and leaves for enhanced protection against rain", "wildlife": "Small game and birds are active but wary; predators remain cautious, particularly during periods of low visibility", "danger_level": "Moderate (slippery terrain due to ongoing rain, cautious predator activity)", "notes_for_future": {"wildlife_alert": "Predator activity may increase after rain as they exploit quieter conditions; maintain caution during low visibility times.", "resource_change": "Shelter reinforcement has improved protection, allowing more focus on foraging. Roots and mushrooms near large trees continue to be reliable food sources.", "environmental_shift": "Persistent rain increases the risk of slippery terrain, necessitating careful movement. Monitor stream levels for any signs of flooding or changes in water accessibility."}}}'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o', 'temperature': 0.8}}
