ivity was monitored to ensure safety during resource gathering.', 'Strategic Resource Management': 'Proficiency improved through prioritizing critical actions based on environmental conditions such as shelter reinforcement, maintaining hydration, and cautious foraging.'}}, 'simulation_day_count': 10, 'day_luck_factor': 8, 'simulation_total_days': 10, 'llm_model': 'gpt', 'verbose': True}
